Every icon in this directory is an unmodified Lucide glyph
(https://lucide.dev). Filenames keep this project's own naming; the upstream
name follows each one:

  Arrows/arrow-left-fill.svg        arrow-left
  Arrows/chevron-down-fill.svg      chevron-down
  Arrows/chevron-right-fill.svg     chevron-right
  Document/folder-add-fill.svg      folder-plus
  Document/folder-fill.svg          folder
  Document/folder-open-fill.svg     folder-open
  System/add-box-fill.svg           square-plus
  System/check-double-fill.svg      check-check
  System/delete-bin-7-fill.svg      trash-2
  System/information-fill.svg       info
  System/mail-fill.svg              mail
  System/rss-fill.svg               rss
  System/settings-5-fill.svg        settings

Lucide is ISC-licensed. Some of these glyphs descend from Feather and carry a
second MIT notice; both are reproduced verbatim below, straight from upstream,
because the ISC and MIT terms each require their notice to travel with the
copies. arrow-left, chevron-down, chevron-right, info, rss, square-plus and
trash-2 are the Feather-derived ones here.

